"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, openrct2.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. The randomizer mod file will be downloaded inside the game's plugin folder ('Documents\\OpenRCT2\\plugin'). If the game's installer toggle was enabled, it will download 'OpenRCT2-v0.5.6-windows-installer-x64.exe' to your Windows 'Downloads' directory. If any map/scenario toggle was enabled it will download them inside the game's scenario folder 'Documents\\OpenRCT2\\scenario'. If the folders don't exist, they will be created automatically.",
