"[HEADER] apworld / yaml Infos",
"kill",
"OpenRCT2 is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file. When 'openrct2.apworld' is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to 'Options Creator' to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld. Remember to select the scenario and length you wanna play on (Sync = shorter sessions while Async = longer sessions).",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
